"3353","In His saying, exalted be He, ""And We have certainly given you, [O Muhammad], seven of the often repeated [verses] and the great Qur'an."" [Al-Hijr: 87] Al-Baqarah, Ali 'Imran, An-Nisa', Al-Ma'idah, Al-An'am, Al-A'raf, and the Surah Al-Kahf."
