"3552","that he heard the Prophet ﷺ say, “A servant ˹of God˺ is not provided a thing better and more expansive for him than patience.”"
"3553",""
"3554","Sūrat al-Aḥzāb was equivalent ˹in size˺ to Sūrat al-Baqarah and there was ˹an Āyah˺ in it: ""al-shaykhu wa-al-shaykhah idhā zanayā fārjumūhumā al-battata (The ˹married˺ man and a woman, if they commit adultery, then absolutely stone them.)""[^1]"
"3555",""
"3556",""
"3557",""
"3558",""
"3559",""
"3560",""
"3561",""
"3562","I was in the Masjid then al-ʿAbbās and ʿAlī came to me and they both said, ""O Usāmah, get permission for us from the Messenger of Allah ﷺ."" Then I entered upon the Prophet ﷺ and asked for his permission and told him that ʿAbbās and ʿAlī are seeking permission."" He said, ""Do you know what they need?"" I said, ""No, by Allah, I do not know."" He said, ""However, I know, allow them ˹to enter˺."" 
