"3636","In His statement, Glory be to Him, ""Our Lord, You caused us to die twice and You gave us life twice"" [Surah Al-Ghafir: 11], He said, ""It is similar to that which is in Surah Al-Baqarah, 'You were lifeless, then We gave you life; then We caused you to die; then We revived you' [Surah Al-Baqarah: 28]."""
