"3658","the Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: ""Whosoever makes all ˹his˺ concerns into one concern (meaning, the concern of the Hereafter), Allah will relieve him of ˹all˺ concerns of his world. And whosoever is indulged ˹only˺ in concerns ˹of this world˺, Allah will not care in which of the valleys of this world he dies.""[^1]"
